# Skirmish start (docs/re/ui_phase5.md "Phase 5d"), 1280x720, 60 fps clock,
# with an EMPTY save dir (no options.txt -> the update news screen comes first):
#   mkdir -p /tmp/py_save && rm -f /tmp/py_save/options.txt
#   SDL_VIDEODRIVER=offscreen ./build-game/ProjectY --data data --save-dir /tmp/py_save \
#       --frames 1300 --input tools/ui/skirmish_start.input
# Path: update news -> Back -> main -> Singleplayer -> Custom Game -> Start
# Game (map 1, Icy Isle) -> ingame -> Esc (statistics) -> Main menu (pause
# screen) -> Surrender -> "Yes, I capitulate!" -> aftermath ("Draw") -> Main menu.
